<title>JAPAN: Sakura Bank says bad loan write-off plan in sight.</title>
<headline>Sakura Bank says bad loan write-off plan in sight.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sakura Bank Ltd hopes to complete a plan by the end of March for the writing-off of most of its bad loans, a senior bank official told a news conference on Friday.</p>
<p>The official did not elaborate on the remarks at the briefing, which followed the announcement of the bank's earnings results for the six months to September 30.</p>
</text>
